        "text": "theorem exists_scales_with_tests (tests : ℕ → Finset κ) (B P γ : ℕ → κ → ℝ) (hγ : ∀ j k, k ∈ tests j → 0 < γ j k) … : ∃ a : ℕ → ℕ, … (∀ j, 2 * a j ≤ a (j+1)) ∧ … ∧ ∀ j k, k ∈ tests j → ∀ r : ℝ, 0 < r → r ≤ 1 / (a j : ℝ) → |DiagonalScale.logPowerWeight (B j k) (P j k) (γ j k) r| ≤ (1/2 : ℝ) ^ j"
